00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:14.630
We recently wrapped up a
competition with a $1 million

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.420
prize that detected
deep-fakes in videos.

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.390
We had a competition recently
with both the NCAA and the NFL.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:23.600
And even abstract
reasoning challenge

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.400
with Francois Chollet.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.210
And by the way, if you haven't
