00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.235
that introduced TPUs for the
first time to our platform.

00:05:11.235 --> 00:05:12.610
We already have
tens of thousands

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.530
of people using TensorFlow 2.x
right now to solve problems.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:19.740
And three of the top solutions
